Thanks for the report. To identify whether this comes from editor restoration, Copilot, or Remote-SSH, could you confirm it on the latest VS Code build and provide:

- results with Copilot disabled, and separately in a local window with the same files restored;
- the busy process shown by **Developer: Open Process Explorer** while the window is unresponsive;
- a performance profile captured using https://github.com/microsoft/vscode/wiki/Performance-Issues;
- the approximate number of restored editors and whether closing them before reopening the workspace avoids the freeze.

The `info-needed` label will automatically close this issue after 7 days without a reply.

